GeoNames city data (cities.js)
  License:   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  Author:    GeoNames
  Source:    https://www.geonames.org/

  The city catalogue is generated by SunApp's update_cities.py from GeoNames
  data (through the geonamescache package and the GeoNames alternate-names
  file), then filtered, merged and repacked, and copied here byte for byte. A
  few Askoy place names below the population cutoff take their coordinates
  from Kartverket's Sentralt stedsnavnregister (CC BY 4.0, (c) Kartverket).
  Full license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

NASA eclipse elements (tools/nasa-elements/, and ts/core/elements.ts made from them)
  Author:    Fred Espenak and Jean Meeus (Five Millennium Canons of Solar and Lunar
             Eclipses, NASA/TP-2006-214141 and NASA/TP-2009-214172)
  Source:    https://eclipse.gsfc.nasa.gov/JSEX/SE2001.js and
             https://eclipse.gsfc.nasa.gov/JLEX/LE2001.js

  Eclipse Predictions by Fred Espenak and Chris O'Byrne (NASA's GSFC). NASA
  allows the data to be reproduced with that acknowledgment. Only the numbers
  are used; the explorers' program code (GPL) is not copied.

